WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:07.567
CompTIA Network Plus, domain 1, Networking concepts, which is 23 percent of the exam.

00:00:07.567 --> 00:00:10.121
This lesson covers objective 1 point 3.

00:00:10.121 --> 00:00:13.396
Summarize cloud concepts and connectivity options.

00:00:13.396 --> 00:00:17.260
Let's pick the right deployment model for a split workload.

00:00:19.600 --> 00:00:25.090
A company must keep sensitive data on premises, but wants its web front end to scale in the cloud.

00:00:25.430 --> 00:00:26.608
One side is private.

00:00:26.608 --> 00:00:28.139
The other is public cloud.

00:00:28.139 --> 00:00:30.730
A connection joins them into one deployment.

00:00:31.070 --> 00:00:31.982
That is hybrid.

00:00:31.982 --> 00:00:36.540
Private alone has no public half, and public alone has no on-premises half.

00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:46.389
When a scenario keeps sensitive data on premises and runs a scalable front end in the public cloud, the answer is hybrid.

00:00:46.389 --> 00:00:49.608
Private alone, or public alone, only describes half.

00:00:49.608 --> 00:00:51.650
That's objective one point three.
